th negative damage amount (e.g. -200)\n42. should calculate premium 165 G for newcomer with cursed sword: 0 years, first insurance -- matches integration example\n43. should calculate premium 160 G for long-standing customer's second contract with cursed sword, enchantment 7 -- matches integration example\n\nTest List Phase Complete. Proceeding to Red phase with the first test."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":1337,"output":2215,"cacheRead":12528,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":16080,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784951613001,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-c616a4cf-0dbf-4b7a-b71f-ade5e954320a","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}}
